{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:628","content":{"id":628,"title":"Floyed 算法","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e649a5b9-94b5-4f50-9cad-39804b492d44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Dijkstra 和 Bellman-Ford 算法解决的都是单源最短路径问题，而 Floyed 算法解决的所有点对之间的最短问题。我们其实可以通过使用 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V","collabId":"c40e71e6-88ce-4eca-93c0-c656ff548452","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 次 Dijkstra 算法就可以求解所有点对之间的最短路径，不过 Dijkstra 算法不能处理负权边的问题，而 Floyed 算法可以处理负权边的问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c09ad834-825f-4611-b237-622eadabc576","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是同 Bellman-Ford 算法一样，如果图中存在负权环的话，就根本不存在最短路径，而我们知道如果无向图中有负权边的话，就相当于存在负权环，所以 Floyed 算法其实也是一个有向图算法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1dd5395a-8059-4d5d-ad47-4831cc911e8e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Floyed 算法的思想也很简单，对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v-w"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，假设它们之间的最短路径表示为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[v][w]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，每一次都要尝试一下绕道点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"t"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会不会得到更短的路径("},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"t"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 从节点 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0","collabId":"dce751fd-db5b-420e-87f4-ad64117b38c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 取值到节点 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V-1","collabId":"6d27d061-8378-4d07-9eae-b77049405bb6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V-1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":")，相当于"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"2309085e-9cf2-416e-a23f-4c2a6ec9c2f7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"22130aa9-516a-45bd-893b-f0070845bcbe","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"for(int t = 0; t < V; t++) {\n    dis[v][w] = Math.min(dis[v][t] + dis[t][w], dis[v][w])\n}","collabId":"6fcf0d0b-9387-442e-bbb2-1f9669cd588c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02f831cd-8dc5-4d70-8e76-a0c8af0aa81d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当经历过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V","collabId":"f0ca43da-35ef-4bfc-bf4b-f4c57efa9484","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 次的绕道尝试后，最终 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[v][w]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之间的最短路径。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1a23c250-b700-4acf-8aef-532470720c1e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外我们也可以通过 Floyed 算法对负权环进行检测，我们知道如果没有负权环的话 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[v][v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值始终是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0","collabId":"f15c173f-58f6-499d-b6a1-e39e96c3fd36","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果存在负权环的话，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[v][v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值就会更新为小于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0","collabId":"06b70440-8a27-40ed-84c1-1360e14646a3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值，在经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V","collabId":"445a465c-98b4-4e26-9b5e-b9a0ac0aa9dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 次绕道之后检查所有的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dis[v][v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是否等于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0","collabId":"1de7f78f-3bd7-4721-adb9-45ad824f3797","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 即可知道图中是否有负权环。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"ad3109ce-ace3-4840-871b-a3022b4a1a69","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3aaf0189-9df7-4658-b210-2834ca54c0da","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.Arrays;\n\npublic class Floyed {\n    private WeightedGraph graph;\n    private int[][] dis;\n    private boolean hasNegativeCycle = false;\n\n    public Floyed(WeightedGraph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        this.dis = new int[graph.V()][graph.V()];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < dis.length; i++) {\n            Arrays.fill(dis[i], Integer.MAX_VALUE);\n        }\n\n        // 初始化 dis[][]\n        for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n            dis[v][v] = 0;\n            for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n                dis[v][w] = graph.getWeight(v, w);\n            }\n        }\n\n        // 绕道尝试\n        for (int t = 0; t < graph.V(); t++) {\n            for(int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n                for (int w = 0; w < graph.V(); w++) {\n                    if (!(dis[v][t] == Integer.MAX_VALUE || dis[t][w] == Integer.MAX_VALUE)) {\n                        dis[v][w] = Math.min(dis[v][w], dis[v][t] + dis[t][w]);\n                    }\n\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 检测负权环\n        for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n            if (dis[v][v] < 0) {\n                hasNegativeCycle = true;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    public int dis(int v, int w) {\n        return dis[v][w];\n    }\n    \n    public boolean isHasNegativeCycle() {\n        return hasNegativeCycle;\n    }\n}","collabId":"fd6d7094-36f0-449b-84b7-d98d1c680c70","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5de1243c-db22-43f2-9553-d6119c9d3363","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Floyed 算法也有时称为 3-for 算法，因为它的算法核心就是三个嵌套的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"for"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 循环，Floyed 算法的实现是这三个算法中最简单的。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"最短路径算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:625","type":"doc","id":625}},{"label":"Floyed 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:628","type":"doc","id":628}}],"prevPage":{"title":"Bellman-Ford 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:627","type":"doc","id":627}},"nextPage":{"title":"有向图算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:629","type":"doc","id":629}},"createTime":1702090073149,"updateTime":1775929581227,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775929581227}}